{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is found, approach and take it. If not, move randomly. Then process it. list of available nodes: <Action ID = TakeObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = SearchForObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToRandomPosition    /> <SubTree ID = ProcessObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectFound    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectInRange    />",
